(7734892, 1274261, 29535, '<td valign="top">It''s a pity this shot doesn''t really fit the challenge well, hence the low score. I think it''s a good, moody shot and a great composition picked out of a difficult location.<br/> <br/>Better luck next time! I look forward to seeing you in future challenges.</td>', 'It''s a pity this shot doesn''t really fit the challenge well, hence the low score. I think it''s a good, moody shot and a great composition picked out of a difficult location. Better luck next time! I look forward to seeing you in future challenges.', '2022-12-18 13:20:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7734905, 1274101, 29535, '<td valign="top">It''s a travesty this didn''t score higher!<br/> <br/>One man''s everyday is another''s nostalgia I guess, who are we to say the sun breaking through the treeline isn''t a nostalgic moment for a past time in our lives?<br/> <br/>I quite like the composition and you''ve done well to expose this correctly. Perhaps the subject itself needed to be stronger in this particular contest.<br/> <br/>Good luck on the next one!</td>', 'It''s a travesty this didn''t score higher! One man''s everyday is another''s nostalgia I guess, who are we to say the sun breaking through the treeline isn''t a nostalgic moment for a past time in our lives? I quite like the composition and you''ve done well to expose this correctly. Perhaps the subject itself needed to be stronger in this particular contest. Good luck on the next one!', '2022-12-18 13:41:03.000000', NULL, 0),
